  "summary": "As a Development Team Lead / Senior .NET Developer, my main responsibility is to guide team members towards successful project deliveries and high standards of software quality; identify and encourage areas for growth and improvement within the team; as well as identify process flaws, brainstorm, formulate, and enforce important process changes or checklists across development teams/departments.\n\nI provide technical leadership to team members through code reviews, paired programming, coaching, and mentorship. I also work closely with various departments, including Product Management, Database Administrators, Quality Engineering, Documentation, Localization, Customer Support, etc. to facilitate communications and resolve technical and non-technical issues.\n\nProponent of Agile Development methodologies, I run daily Scrums as Scrum Master and work with globally distributed agile teams; collaborate with Product and Development Managers and team members for development of user stories, estimates, and work plans.\n\nI am proficient in writing English and Chinese and fluent in speaking English, Mandarin, and Cantonese.",
